      "writtenOn": "2024-06-26T17:54:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, you are correct, that is the intention. \n\nFirst, we increased the size of the btm inquiry database from 80 to 99, reserving 66 slots for EDR and 33 for BLE. \nDespite this increase, we were still able to reproduce the issue where AirPods were not included in the inquiry results in the app.  To address this, we added the p_i null check (changes submitted) and then we were not able to reproduce even once.",
